(How to use this manual) Tj T* T*
/F1 10 Tf
/F1 10 Tf
(This manual applies to all employees of Ashgrove Regional Transit. Parts 1 to 3 describe depots,) Tj T*
(routes and vehicles. Part 4 covers pay and leave. Parts 5 and 8 cover safety and conduct.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Part 9 contains amendments. When an amendment conflicts with an earlier section, the amendment) Tj T*
(applies.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Questions about this manual should be sent to the safety director or the head of human resources,) Tj T*
(whose contacts are listed in section 10.4.) Tj T*
T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 24 Td (Page 3 of 100) Tj ET
endstream
