BT 40 800 Td 12 TL /F1 8 Tf
(Ashgrove Regional Transit - Operations and Employee Manual - 2027 Edition) Tj T* T*
T*
/F2 14 Tf
(1.1 Larkfield Depot) Tj T* T*
/F1 10 Tf
/F1 10 Tf
(Larkfield Depot \(depot code LKF\) is located at 14 Quarry Road. The Larkfield depot manager is) Tj T*
(Imani Okafor. The Larkfield safety officer is Tomasz Wrona. The Larkfield gatehouse is staffed) Tj T*
(from 04:30 to 00:45, seven days a week.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Larkfield has 62 parking bays. Larkfield has 18 charging points. The speed limit inside the) Tj T*
(Larkfield yard is 12 km/h. The Larkfield duty desk is reached on extension 4101.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Services operated from Larkfield are Route 5, Route 31. Rosters are published on the staff portal) Tj T*
(every second Thursday and printed copies are displayed in the mess room.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(All staff entering the yard sign in at the gatehouse using a personal identity card. Visitors are) Tj T*
(escorted at all times and are issued with a temporary pass that must be returned before leaving) Tj T*
(the site. Contractors must show a current site induction record before any work begins, and the) Tj T*
(record is checked against the contractor register held by the duty desk.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Vehicles returning at the end of service are refuelled or placed on charge, cleaned, and parked) Tj T*
(according to the allocation sheet for the following morning. Any defect noticed during the shift) Tj T*
(is written on the defect card and handed to the night maintenance team, who decide whether the) Tj T*
(vehicle is fit for the next duty.) Tj T*
T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 24 Td (Page 4 of 100) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
