BT 40 800 Td 12 TL /F1 8 Tf
(Ashgrove Regional Transit - Operations and Employee Manual - 2027 Edition) Tj T* T*
T*
/F2 11 Tf
(Larkfield Depot local operating notes) Tj T* T*
/F1 10 Tf
/F1 10 Tf
(Local rule at Larkfield: Buses over 12 metres must enter through Gate B because Gate A has a 3.4) Tj T*
(metre height bar.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Local rules are agreed between the depot manager and the safety officer and are reviewed at the) Tj T*
(quarterly depot safety meeting. Changes take effect only after they have been posted on the depot) Tj T*
(notice board for seven days. If a local rule appears to conflict with a procedure in Part 5 of) Tj T*
(this manual, the stricter of the two applies until the safety team has given a ruling.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(The mess room is open throughout gatehouse hours and contains lockers, a kitchen area and a quiet) Tj T*
(room. Lockers are allocated by the duty desk and are emptied after an employee has left the depot.) Tj T*
(Personal items are left at the owner's risk, and valuables should not be kept in vehicles at any) Tj T*
(time.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(New drivers complete a route familiarisation drive for each service operated from the depot before) Tj T*
(taking passengers. A driver who has not operated a route for six months repeats the) Tj T*
(familiarisation drive before returning to that route. Records of these drives are held by the duty) Tj T*
(desk and are checked when rosters are prepared.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(The first vehicle of the morning undergoes a walk-round check witnessed by the shift supervisor.) Tj T*
(The check covers tyres, lights, mirrors, doors, the ramp and the emergency exits. Later vehicles) Tj T*
(are checked by the driver alone and the result is recorded on the handheld ticket machine.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Waste oil, coolant and tyres are stored in the marked compound and collected by an approved) Tj T*
(contractor. Spills are dealt with according to the procedures in Part 5, and the depot keeps) Tj T*
(absorbent materials next to each fuelling point.) Tj T*
T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 24 Td (Page 5 of 100) Tj ET
endstream
