T*
/F2 14 Tf
(1.12 Thornbury Vale Depot) Tj T* T*
/F1 10 Tf
/F1 10 Tf
(Thornbury Vale Depot \(depot code TBV\) is located at 19 Copper Lane. The Thornbury Vale depot) Tj T*
(manager is Yusuf Demir. The Thornbury Vale safety officer is Isla Campbell. The Thornbury Vale) Tj T*
(gatehouse is staffed from 05:20 to 23:20, seven days a week.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Thornbury Vale has 45 parking bays. Thornbury Vale has 16 charging points. The speed limit inside) Tj T*
(the Thornbury Vale yard is 10 km/h. The Thornbury Vale duty desk is reached on extension 4112.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Services operated from Thornbury Vale are Route 29, Route 52. Rosters are published on the staff) Tj T*
(portal every second Thursday and printed copies are displayed in the mess room.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(All staff entering the yard sign in at the gatehouse using a personal identity card. Visitors are) Tj T*
(escorted at all times and are issued with a temporary pass that must be returned before leaving) Tj T*
(the site. Contractors must show a current site induction record before any work begins, and the) Tj T*
(record is checked against the contractor register held by the duty desk.) Tj T*
T*
/F1 10 Tf
(Vehicles returning at the end of service are refuelled or placed on charge, cleaned, and parked) Tj T*
(according to the allocation sheet for the following morning. Any defect noticed during the shift) Tj T*
(is written on the defect card and handed to the night maintenance team, who decide whether the) Tj T*
(vehicle is fit for the next duty.) Tj T*
T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 280 24 Td (Page 26 of 100) Tj ET
